  "label": "Hulk's Rules",
  "description": "The phrase 'Hulk's Rules' is a slogan associated with Hulk Hogan, often printed on his merchandise and t-shirts. It is part of his persona and reinforces his image as a dominant, rule-following (or rule-breaking) force in wrestling. Understanding this slogan is necessary to recognize the visual and cultural context of the image.",
